      "message": "feat(machines): built-in Makera Z1 posting through the Carvera post\n\nZ1 from Makera's published specs: 200x200x100 mm, 0-13000 rpm, 0.15 kW,\n1200 mm/min, manual quick-change, Air M7. Dialect match to carvera.cps is\nnot confirmed publicly; noted in docs/decisions/868-makera-z1.md.\n\nFixes #868\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
